<title>UK: Japanese share market in London closed for holiday.</title>
<headline>Japanese share market in London closed for holiday.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Japanese share market in London was closed on Tuesday due to a public holiday in Japan. The market will resume trading on Thursday, January 2.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
